Z||000000||RobMich||06-12-2001||06:24 PM||||This is the one I had been looking for for years!!!  Received delivery from a collector in Alaska of a....<P>1988 GT - Red, every option, leather, stored<BR>since 11/88 and driven only 10 miles yearly.<P>Purchased with 1040 miles, I received it today with 1171 miles on the odometer!!<P>It is as clean and you can possibly imagine, still has the leather smell, hasn't even had the big recall done to it (which I will get done).<BR> <BR>I am in Fiero Heaven!!!!<P>Rob||||reg||6
Z||000001||skitime||06-12-2001||06:29 PM||||PICS PICS PICS PICS  I want to see it!<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||RRobinson||06-12-2001||08:15 PM||||Hey, I can totally relate.<BR>A couple weeks ago I found my dream car- same thing as yours...<BR>88 GT 5-speed #1881<BR>Bright red<BR>Black wheels<BR> <BR>All options except the sub and leather.<BR>Bought from original local owner, he bought it in summer 88 as a demo w/7500km (4600 miles. It currently has 8900kms (5500 miles).<P>It's the best one I've ever seen in person, and is brand new in all respects. <BR>I'm lucky to have it and plan on keeping it forever.<BR>But if I find one with T-tops, tan leather, and gold wheels...<P>Ryan<BR>2-88 GTs Twins- One 5-speed, One Auto<BR>2-87 GTs Black & Blue <BR>87 SE V6 <BR>86 GT 5-speed<BR>||||reg||1
